---
layout: default
---
{% assign resume_url = '/assets/rendercv/rendercv_output/Tahmid_Zaman_Tahi_CV.pdf' | relative_url %}
<div class="portfolio-home">
  <section class="profile-intro" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Tahmid Zaman Tahi</h1>
      <p class="profile-role">PhD researcher · Virginia Commonwealth University</p>
      <p>
        Advised by Dr. Yanxiao Zhao, I study machine learning for wireless communications and sensing, with a focus on intelligent surfaces,
        localization, and modulation recognition.
      </p>
      <p class="availability">I’m seeking PhD research internships in wireless communications, sensing, and machine learning.</p>
      <nav class="profile-links" aria-label="Contact and professional profiles">
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.data.socials.email }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> Email</a>
        <a href="{{ resume_url }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i> Résumé</a>
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user={{ site.data.socials.scholar_userid }}">Scholar</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/{{ site.data.socials.github_username }}">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/{{ site.data.socials.linkedin_username }}">LinkedIn</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <img
      class="profile-photo"
      src="{{ '/assets/img/tahmid-zaman-tahi.jpg' | relative_url }}"
      alt="Tahmid Zaman Tahi"
      width="180"
      height="220"
      fetchpriority="high"
    >
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
    <h2 id="research-heading">Research</h2>
    <p>
      My work combines physical-layer models with learned methods: estimating wireless channels and source locations, recognizing modulation from I/Q
      signals, and monitoring the reliability of connected-vehicle systems. I’m interested in how channel conditions and array geometry can guide the
      design of these methods.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ '/research/' | relative_url }}">Research overview</a>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="news-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="news-heading">News &amp; Updates</h2>
      <a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">All updates</a>
    </div>
    {% assign news_items = site.news | where_exp: 'item', 'item.homepage != false' | sort: 'date' | reverse %}
    <ul class="news-list">
      {% for item in news_items limit: 4 %}
        <li>
          <time datetime="{{ item.date | date: '%Y-%m' }}">{{ item.date | date: '%b %Y' }}</time>
          <span>
            {%- if item.inline -%}
              {{- item.content | strip_html -}}
            {%- else -%}
              <a href="{{ item.url | relative_url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section selected-work" aria-labelledby="publications-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="publications-heading">Selected Publications</h2>
      <a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}">All publications</a>
    </div>
    <div class="publications">{% bibliography --query @*[selected=true] --group_by none %}</div>
    <p class="project-index-link">
      Additional implementations and earlier work are on the <a href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Projects page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
    <h2 id="skills-heading">Technical Background</h2>
    <dl class="expertise-list">
      <div>
        <dt>Wireless &amp; physical layer</dt>
        <dd>
          MIMO, antenna arrays, beamforming, CSI estimation, RIS/IRS, NOMA/SIC, modulation and detection, link budgets, fading, and BER/SINR analysis.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Signal processing &amp; sensing</dt>
        <dd>
          Complex I/Q processing, covariance estimation, MUSIC and MVDR, angle/range estimation, near-field propagation, and modulation recognition.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Machine learning &amp; simulation</dt>
        <dd>
          PyTorch, TensorFlow, CNNs, LSTMs, transformers, conditional networks, and reinforcement learning; Python, MATLAB/Simulink, NumPy, SciPy, C,
          and Linux.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Networking &amp; systems</dt>
        <dd>C-V2X/NR-V2X, HARQ, resource allocation, network planning, IoT monitoring, Arduino, and ThingSpeak.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
    <h2 id="background-heading">Education &amp; Experience</h2>
    <ul class="background-list">
      <li>
        <span>2025–present</span>
        <div>
          <strong>PhD, Electrical and Computer Engineering</strong> · Virginia Commonwealth University<br>
          Graduate Research Assistant, advised by Dr. Yanxiao Zhao.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>2023–2024</span>
        <div>
          <strong>MS, Electrical Engineering</strong> · The George Washington University<br>
          Graduate Teaching Assistant in signals, systems, DSP, and engineering courses.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>2021–2022</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Engineer, Network Infrastructure</strong> · ADN Telecom Limited<br>
          Link budgets, network planning, and IoT-based network monitoring.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>2017–2021</span>
        <div>
          <strong>BS, Electrical and Electronic Engineering</strong> · Islamic University of Technology<br>
          Undergraduate thesis on C-V2X sidelink retransmission.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section personal-note" aria-labelledby="notes-heading">
    <h2 id="notes-heading"><a href="{{ '/notes/' | relative_url }}">Field Notes</a></h2>
    <p>Writing about research, travel, and life outside the lab.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading">Start a conversation</h2>
    <p>
      For research collaborations or internship opportunities, reach me at
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.data.socials.email }}">{{ site.data.socials.email }}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
